A device for cardiac surgery is disclosed, comprising:

a) a plurality of pairs of suture guides distributed about the frame;

b) a plurality of suture tubes, each corresponding to a respective pair of suture guides;

c) a plurality of snares, each corresponding to and threaded through one of the plurality of suture tubes such that a handle at one end of the snare projects from a proximal end of the corresponding suture tube, while a snare loop at the opposite end of the snare projects through a distal end of the corresponding suture tube, the snare loop further projecting through one of the suture guides in the corresponding pair of suture guides; and

d) a plurality of sutures, each corresponding to one of the pairs of suture guides and coupled to the suture guide, within the corresponding pair, through which the snare loop does not pass.
